OL,3,GNEWSAMan held on suspicion of witness
OL,4,Aintimidation at drug and rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fwitness intimidation in relation to the
OL,8,Ftrial of nine men accused of sexual
OL,9,Foffences against a woman who was
OL,10,Fdrugged and raped by her husband for 20
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FA 35-year-old man was arrested in the
OL,14,Ffoyer of Minshull Street Crown Court in
OL,15,FManchester earlier, Greater Manchester
OL,16,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
