OL,3,GNEWSAMan held on suspicion of witness
OL,4,Aintimidation at drug and rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine defendants have pleaded not guilty
OL,7,Fto various charges against them,
OL,8,Frelating to the abuse of the woman from
OL,9,FStockport. Her husband, who cannot be
OL,10,Fidentified to protect her identity, has
OL,11,Fpleaded guilty to multiple sexual
OL,12,Foffences, dating back to 2004.
OL,14,FThe force said the arrested man remains
OL,15,Fin custody for questioning.
